    "\n",
    "## Phase 5: Deep Learning Models (Weeks 17-24)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Week 17-18: Recurrent Neural Networks (RNN)\n",
    "\n",
    "**What to Learn:**\n",
    "- Basic RNN architecture for sequential data[36][37][8]\n",
    "- Vanishing gradient problem in RNNs[36]\n",
    "- SimpleRNN implementation in TensorFlow/Keras[37][38]\n",
    "\n",
    "**Practice Tasks:**\n",
    "- Build basic RNN for Bitcoin price prediction[37]\n",
    "- Understand sequence-to-sequence modeling[38][37]\n",
    "\n",
    "**Code Example:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.models import Sequential\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.layers import SimpleRNN, Dense\n",
    "\n",
    "# RNN Model\n",
    "model = Sequential()\n",
    "model.add(SimpleRNN(units=50, return_sequences=True, input_shape=(X_train.shape[1], 1)))\n",
    "model.add(SimpleRNN(units=50))\n",
    "model.add(Dense(units=1))\n",
    "model.compile(optimizer='adam', loss='mean_squared_error')\n",
    "model.fit(X_train, y_train, epochs=50, batch_size=32)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "***\n",
    "\n",
    "### Week 19-20: Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM)\n",
    "\n",
    "**What to Learn:**\n",
    "- LSTM architecture (forget gate, input gate, output gate)[5][4][36]\n",
    "- Cell state and hidden state concepts[4][36]\n",
    "- Bidirectional LSTM for better context[36]\n",
    "\n",
    "**Practice Tasks:**\n",
    "- Build single-layer and multi-layer LSTM models[39][5][4]\n",
    "- Implement LSTM for Bitcoin price forecasting[40][5][4]\n",
    "- Compare LSTM vs vanilla RNN performance[28][36]\n",
    "\n",
    "**Code Example:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.layers import LSTM, Dropout\n",
    "\n",
    "# LSTM Model\n",
    "model = Sequential()\n",
    "model.add(LSTM(units=50, return_sequences=True, input_shape=(X_train.shape[1], 1)))\n",
    "model.add(Dropout(0.2))\n",
    "model.add(LSTM(units=50, return_sequences=True))\n",
    "model.add(Dropout(0.2))\n",
    "model.add(LSTM(units=50))\n",
    "model.add(Dropout(0.2))\n",
    "model.add(Dense(units=1))\n",
    "model.compile(optimizer='adam', loss='mean_squared_error')\n",
    "model.fit(X_train, y_train, epochs=100, batch_size=32, validation_split=0.1)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why LSTM is Better:**\n",
    "LSTM solves vanishing gradient problem and captures long-term dependencies in volatile crypto markets.[5][4][36]\n",
    "\n",
    "***\n",
    "\n",
    "### Week 21-22: Gated Recurrent Units (GRU)\n",
    "\n",
    "**What to Learn:**\n",
    "- GRU architecture (update gate, reset gate)[41][36]\n",
    "- Comparison: LSTM vs GRU (computational efficiency)[42][41][36]\n",
