    "## Phase 7: Model Optimization & Deployment (Weeks 29-32)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Week 29-30: Hyperparameter Tuning\n",
    "\n",
    "**What to Learn:**\n",
    "- Grid Search, Random Search, Bayesian Optimization[51][52][53]\n",
    "- Time series cross-validation (TimeSeriesSplit)[51][10]\n",
    "- Learning rate scheduling, early stopping[52][53]\n",
    "\n",
    "**Practice Tasks:**\n",
    "- Use GridSearchCV for ARIMA parameters[53]\n",
    "- Implement Bayesian optimization for LSTM hyperparameters[54][52][51]\n",
    "- Tune XGBoost using Optuna or Hyperopt[53][51]\n",
    "\n",
    "**Code Example:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import TimeSeriesSplit, GridSearchCV\n",
    "\n",
    "# Grid Search for XGBoost\n",
    "param_grid = {\n",
    "    'n_estimators': [100, 500, 1000],\n",
    "    'learning_rate': [0.01, 0.05, 0.1],\n",
    "    'max_depth': [3, 5, 7]\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "tscv = TimeSeriesSplit(n_splits=5)\n",
    "grid_search = GridSearchCV(XGBRegressor(), param_grid, cv=tscv, scoring='neg_mean_squared_error')\n",
    "grid_search.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
    "print(f'Best params: {grid_search.best_params_}')\n",
    "```\n",
