    "- Deploy model to AWS/Azure for real-time API predictions[57]\n",
    "\n",
    "**Evaluation Metrics:**\n",
    "- MAE (Mean Absolute Error): $$\\text{MAE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}|y_i - \\hat{y}_i|$$[11][6]\n",
    "- RMSE (Root Mean Squared Error): $$\\text{RMSE} = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(y_i - \\hat{y}_i)^2}$$[11][6]\n",
    "- MAPE (Mean Absolute Percentage Error): $$\\text{MAPE} = \\frac{100}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}|\\frac{y_i - \\hat{y}_i}{y_i}|$$[24]\n",
    "\n",
