    "\n",
    "## Key Takeaways & Warnings\n",
    "\n",
    "### What Works for Crypto:\n",
    "- **Short-term predictions** (1-7 days) are more reliable than long-term[14][11][23]\n",
    "- **Hybrid models** (ARIMA + LSTM, XGBoost + LSTM) often outperform single models[33][35]\n",
    "- **Technical indicators** (RSI, MACD, EMA) significantly improve accuracy[6][20]\n",
    "- **Ensemble methods** reduce overfitting and improve robustness[35]\n",
    "\n",
    "### What Doesn't Work Well:\n",
    "- Pure ARIMA struggles with crypto's extreme volatility[12][11][23]\n",
    "- Simple models fail to capture non-linear patterns[14][23]\n",
    "- Long-term forecasts (30+ days) are highly unreliable due to market unpredictability[14][23]\n",
    "\n",
    "### Research Findings:\n",
    "- **LSTM and GRU outperform ARIMA** for crypto by 20-30% in RMSE[28][4][5]\n",
    "- **XGBoost with engineered features** achieves near-perfect R² (0.95+) on test data[20][6]\n",
    "- **Transformers show promise** but require massive datasets (10,000+ samples)[46][47]\n",
    "- **Naive models sometimes outperform complex DL** on highly random crypto assets[23]\n",
    "\n",
