    "Based on your goal of building a crypto prediction app, I recommend this **fast-track path**:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Weeks 1-8:** Master foundations + feature engineering\n",
    "2. **Weeks 9-12:** Skip basic ARIMA, focus on **Prophet + XGBoost**\n",
    "3. **Weeks 13-20:** Deep dive into **LSTM** (your core model)\n",
    "4. **Weeks 21-24:** Add **GRU** for comparison\n",
    "5. **Weeks 25-28:** Experiment with **Transformers** (optional but impressive)\n",
    "6. **Weeks 29-32:** Focus heavily on **hyperparameter tuning** and **deployment**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Your Priority Stack:**\n",
    "1. LSTM (most proven for crypto)[4][28][5]\n",
    "2. XGBoost (excellent for feature-rich data)[6][20]\n",
    "3. Prophet (fast baseline)[24][25]\n",
    "4. Ensemble all three for final predictions[35]\n",
    "\n",
    "This roadmap will take you from zero to building a production-ready cryptocurrency prediction system. Stay consistent, practice daily, and remember: **crypto markets are inherently unpredictable**, so focus on building robust models with proper risk management rather than chasing perfect accuracy![62][14][23]\n",
